  "knownGapNotes": {
    "puppeteers-shroud": "[Enhanced Durability] is never described: the book calls it self-explanatory (83:36) and only prints [Doubtless]'s description (83:34); the only other listing (2038:29) is Rain's copy, also undescribed.",
    "carapace-scavenger": "[Strong] and [Armored] are only ever listed (47:12); the Echo is destroyed at 67:0, before Sunny can read attribute descriptions, and no other passage describes them.",
    "stone-saint-echo": "[Mark of Divinity] is described only as Sunny's own Attribute (3:15, 85:39), both before the Echo exists; anchoring that line to the Echo would show it in ch 104–105, before the book reveals the Echo has it (105:12). The Echo's sheet is only on screen in ch 106 anyway.",
    "stone-saint": "Saint's runes never describe her [Spark of Divinity] (106:36, 182:14, 273:51 only list it; 106:37 is narration). The described [Spark of Divinity] at 85:44 is Sunny's own Attribute (\"within your soul\"), printed before Saint exists — not reused (same call as onyx-saint's Ember in descriptions-c).",
    "marble-saint": "Same [Spark of Divinity] as the Stone Saint: only listed (310:41, 376:50), never described in her runes.",
    "weavers-mask": "At 278:43 the book says the second enchantment is [???] and its description empty; it is revealed as [Where is my eye?] at 456:17–18, which the later sheet shows.",
    "onyx-saint": "Spark of Divinity (listed until the 1000 sheet): only listed in Saint's runes, like Stone/Marble Saint; never described. Her Ember of Divinity is explained by the story at 1000:17 (told for)."
  }
